1790467559710269	maw-lsz75n	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-1cth	{"body":"bn-1cth evidence (workspace bn-1cth, commit e65c0024)\n\nREPRO BEFORE FIX (pre-fix release binary, greenfield consolidated repo, .maw/manifold/config.toml [merge.validation] command=false on_failure=quarantine):\n- Defect 2 CONFIRMED: quarantine worktree created at <root>/ws/merge-quarantine-<id> inside the trunk checkout; root git status showed \"?? ws/\"; maw ws list did not show it. Note: [merge.validation] is only read from .maw/manifold/config.toml, not .maw.toml.\n- Defect 1 CONFIRMED: maw merge abandon ../../../../victim deleted an out-of-tree dir containing state.json = {} (WARNING parse error, then \"[OK] abandoned\").\n- Extra (same class, fixed): maw merge promote in consolidated layout skipped the default refresh because refresh_default_after_promote used workspace_path(root,\"default\") -> root left with phantom \"D hello.txt\" staged. Now default_target_path.\n\nKANI (maw-core, validated_merge_id_is_single_component_ids_le_8_bytes, 3.6s): accepted ids <=8 bytes over {. / - a 0} are non-empty, contain no '/', are not . or ..\n- Mutation M1: allow '/' in charset -> \"Failed Checks: assertion failed: !b.contains(&b'/')\" VERIFICATION FAILED. Reverted.\n- Mutation M2: allow '.' in charset -> \"Failed Checks: assertion failed: b != b\".\" && b != b\"..\"\" VERIFICATION FAILED. Reverted.\n- Path-level and WorkspaceId-level Kani harnesses were intractable (std::path and WorkspaceId::new format!/String: >10 min CBMC at 3-4 bytes, killed). Those properties are instead checked by exhaustive unit test exhaustive_ids_le_7_bytes_are_contained_and_named (all 97656 ids <=7 bytes, real Path + WorkspaceId::new). M1/M2 turn it red; M3 (disable the \"--\" rule) turns it red at the WorkspaceId assertion while Kani stays green (expected: containment is unaffected).\n\nREGRESSION TEST tests/quarantine_consolidated_bn_1cth.rs: both tests RED against the pre-fix binary (abandon ../../../victim succeeded; quarantine not under .maw/workspaces), GREEN after fix. Lifecycle assertion (promote refreshes root) was RED until the default_target_path fix.\n\nGATES: cargo build --release -p maw-cli OK; just check EXIT 0 (no FAILED/error lines)."}	blake3:if_hVQQC5CcMrmxkuQt8H3UOj54aQCwYx89uJifMImA
1790467599457269	maw-lsz75n	itc:AQ		item.move	bn-1cth	{"state":"done"}	blake3:_l_AsFIDHn7d9QGfJT6AvbbJUkT8Z8i6vrNrK0LIe0Q
1790467619092966	maw-lsz75n	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-ila3	{"description":"FOUND BY: bn-1cth worker, 2026-09-26 (not yet independently verified — verify each\nbefore fixing).\n\n1. src/merge/validate.rs:292 hardcodes repo_root.join(\".manifold\").join(\"validate-tmp\"),\n   so every validation run in a consolidated repo creates a stray empty `.manifold/`\n   at the repo root (gitignored, but wrong). Same class as bn-1lj2. Route via\n   LayoutFlavor::manifold_dir (crates/maw-core/src/model/layout.rs).\n2. [merge.validation] is read only from .maw/manifold/config.toml; putting it in\n   .maw.toml (which the bootstrap config comment calls the user-editable location) is\n   silently ignored. Decide the intended precedence (check how other [merge] keys are\n   loaded in crates/maw-core/src/config.rs), fix, and warn on unknown/ignored sections\n   if feasible.\n3. Quarantine workspaces (merge-quarantine-<id>) now live under .maw/workspaces/ and\n   appear in `maw ws list` as ordinary siblings. Check how later merges treat them:\n   auto-rebase (crates/maw-cli/src/workspace/auto_rebase.rs) and FF-absorb sibling\n   fast-forward (reconcile_epoch_with_branch in merge.rs). A quarantine holds a\n   candidate merge tree that must not be rebased/fast-forwarded out from under\n   `maw merge promote`. Write a test: create quarantine, merge an unrelated workspace,\n   then promote — promote must still work and produce the fixed candidate. If\n   quarantines should be excluded from sibling handling, exclude by\n   QUARANTINE_NAME_PREFIX. NOTE: bn-27n7 is refactoring the FF-absorb region — if\n   item 3 needs merge.rs changes in that region, wait for bn-27n7 to merge.\n\nACCEPTANCE: each item fixed with a regression test or documented as not-a-bug with\nevidence; just check green.\n","kind":"bug","labels":["merge","layout"],"parent":"bn-2ws4","size":"s","title":"Merge validation/quarantine layout leftovers: stray .manifold/validate-tmp, ignored .maw.toml [merge.validation], quarantine as FF-absorb sibling"}	blake3:oUGl1ePB26A1s4LZtw4wcX0FgjQusNcR46fg3pBEaTg
