1790470797531081	maw-lsz75n	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-302v	{"body":"Lead: scope additions before dispatch (2026-09-26).\n(C) From bn-27n7: crates/maw-core/src/merge/ff_plan.rs classify_sibling FAST-FORWARDS a CLEAN sibling whose HEAD is Unreadable (historical behaviour kept by the refactor, documented in its doc comment). If the HEAD read fails transiently on a sibling that actually has commits ahead, sync_ff_paths_in_worktree can reopen the repo and detach HEAD to target, orphaning those commits. Change to fail closed: Unreadable HEAD => SkipStaleDirty-like skip (leave stale, warn) regardless of dirty. Update the Kani harnesses in ff_plan_kani.rs (the existing unreadable harness) and mutation-check.\n(D) From bn-3w2b: doctor --repair (crates/maw-cli/src/workspace/epoch_drift.rs auto_advance_if_safe, now epoch-locked + CAS per bn-32g8) can still advance the epoch while an unfinished merge COMMIT journal exists (crashed merge), same shape bn-3w2b fixed for quarantine promote via QuarantineError::MergeInProgress. Refuse/skip in that case too. Model it in crates/maw-assurance (doctor actor already exists) with a must-fail mutation."}	blake3:W0yEoEAGIaAgACUc05xm3gtEfkV_5zVbkH6tSah7nN0
1790470803894533	maw-lsz75n	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-2dyz	{"description":"FOUND BY: bn-3w2b/bn-ila3 worker, 2026-09-26. Verify each before fixing.\n\n1. Config path split (most important): in the consolidated layout the manifold\n   config is read from .maw/manifold/config.toml by merge, but from\n   .maw/config.toml by get_backend and by the FF-absorb reconcile\n   (reconcile_epoch_with_branch — e.g. auto_absorb_ff). A user setting in one file\n   is silently ignored by the other code paths. Find every config load site\n   (grep ManifoldConfig::load / config.toml in crates/maw-cli and src/), pick the\n   single canonical path per LayoutFlavor (crates/maw-core/src/model/layout.rs),\n   read legacy location as fallback with a deprecation warning. Regression test:\n   set auto_absorb_ff=false in the canonical file and confirm merge honors it.\n2. `maw ws list` shows merge-quarantine-* workspaces as \"ready to merge\" and suggests\n   `maw ws merge merge-quarantine-<id> --destroy`; a manual `maw ws sync` would\n   rebase one (auto-rebase and FF-absorb now skip them, bn-ila3). Show them as\n   quarantines with the promote/abandon commands; make `ws sync`/`ws merge` refuse\n   them with a pointer to `maw merge promote|abandon`.\n3. src/merge/collect.rs still reads <root>/.manifold/fileids (read-only) — route via\n   the layout manifold dir.\n\nACCEPTANCE: each fixed with a regression test or documented as not-a-bug; just\ncheck green.\n","kind":"bug","labels":["layout","merge"],"parent":"bn-2ws4","size":"s","title":"Consolidated-layout leftovers: manifold config path split, quarantines shown as mergeable, collect.rs .manifold/fileids"}	blake3:zEqdnlwnmaipY7BnQK-Its65e5kYcsdJrvx-cgO0KXY
