1790476010165617	maw-lsz75n	itc:AQ		item.move	bn-1svi	{"state":"done"}	blake3:RpKs-yXrgHZe2VaH31AeUvEefUP8k0-_Mix1ZRAZtGU
1790476783974154	maw-lsz75n	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-2ws4	{"body":"Lead summary 2026-09-26: all children merged except bn-7p3r (Verus, deferred). Trunk c34bdbea (local, not pushed). Final gates on trunk: just check green (107 test-result lines); kani-fast 13+22+6 = 41 harnesses verified (root, maw-core, maw-lfs); formal-check (Stateright, all configs incl deep) green. Data-loss/corruption bugs found and fixed via this goal: bn-1lwk (k-way sides dropped), bn-28os (resolve dropped bystander edits), bn-34zv (atom resolve joined lines), bn-2jml (D/F clash committed corrupt tree), bn-302v (FF-absorb ref-before-HEAD silent revert + agent TOCTOU), bn-32g8 (doctor epoch regress), bn-3maj (gc collected fresh pins), bn-1cth (merge abandon path escape), bn-1u93 (concurrent create vs prune). Release notes must cover these."}	blake3:a1_NOKZ4LDdWpzr8GCkaTLP80yIeTm8Tm88W8XR57vA
1790528142215640	maw-68q58s	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-1eyd	{"description":"OBJECTIVE\nShip the bn-2ws4 formal-verification work (many data-loss fixes) as\nv1.0.0-pre.16, after the standard pre-release fresh-eyes sweep.\n\nSWEEP METHOD (standard pre-release step, see memory 2026-08-26)\nFor the assigned slice of code changed in v1.0.0-pre.15..HEAD: randomly sample\nchanged functions, trace their call paths and data flow end to end, look for\ndefects (data loss / Prime Invariant violations first, then crash-safety,\nconcurrency, fail-open error handling, layout assumptions, panics, wrong\nmessages). For each real defect: reproduce (test or scratch repro), fix with a\nred-first regression test, mutation-check. Record every finding (fixed or not)\nas a bone comment with file:line, repro and disposition. Do not \"fix\" style.\n\nDONE WHEN: three sweep bones closed and merged, release notes written from the\nbone comments + CHANGELOG Unreleased, `maw release prepare/preflight` green,\ntagged, pushed, GH prerelease created, installed.\n","kind":"goal","labels":["release"],"size":"l","title":"Release v1.0.0-pre.16: fresh-eyes sweep of pre.15..HEAD, then cut the release"}	blake3:drkr0oGEh7VKdUjReoR26qqOA0CnJBngPBdYEnAk8bE
1790528162090002	maw-68q58s	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-22nk	{"description":"Fresh-eyes sweep (method in parent bn-1eyd) run by codex --model gpt-6-astra via\nvessel. SLICE (changes in v1.0.0-pre.15..HEAD):\n  src/merge/resolve.rs (bn-1lwk kway_conflict_participants/kway_conflict_atoms,\n    bystanders), src/merge/apply_resolution.rs (new: bn-34zv/bn-28os resolution\n    application), crates/maw-core/src/merge/partition.rs (bn-2jml detect_df_clashes),\n    crates/maw-core/src/merge/build.rs (bn-2jml D/F + duplicate-entry guard),\n    src/merge/build_phase.rs (epoch-delta reserved id guard, config loading),\n    src/merge/collect.rs (layout-aware fileids).\nFocus: any path where a workspace's committed edit can be dropped, misattributed,\nor silently resolved; resolution application correctness (CRLF, no trailing\nnewline, deletions, k>=3); AST-merge path parity with the plain path.\n","kind":"task","labels":["release","sweep"],"parent":"bn-1eyd","size":"m","title":"Sweep A (codex gpt-6-astra): merge engine + conflict resolution changed since pre.15"}	blake3:DL7paL1bSu2ILi7mmrBPvwgD9bXp1esj5e1TbChdPWg
1790528162230572	maw-68q58s	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-3rhz	{"description":"Fresh-eyes sweep (method in parent bn-1eyd). SLICE (changes in\nv1.0.0-pre.15..HEAD):\n  crates/maw-cli/src/workspace/merge.rs (bn-302v sibling lock/re-check/HEAD CAS/\n    epoch-ref-last, D2 journal refusal, quarantine skip, config-load change, resolve\n    choice application), crates/maw-core/src/merge/ff_plan.rs,\n  crates/maw-git/src/checkout_impl.rs (set_head_detached_cas),\n  crates/maw-git/src/worktree_impl.rs (bn-1u93 initializing lock marker, prune),\n  crates/maw-git/src/refs_impl.rs (delete_ref_cas),\n  crates/maw-cli/src/workspace/epoch_drift.rs (bn-32g8 lock+CAS, journal refusal),\n  crates/maw-core/src/merge_state.rs (advance_to_commit one-write journal, abort()\n    table, fsync), src/merge/quarantine.rs + crates/maw-cli/src/merge_cmd.rs\n    (locked atomic promote, MergeInProgress), crates/maw-cli/src/changes/mod.rs,\n  crates/maw-cli/src/workspace/sync/ (quarantine refusal), crates/maw-core/src/\n    failpoints.rs (thread-scoped registry — test-only semantics must not leak into\n    production behaviour).\nFocus: lock ordering / deadlock (epoch lock then workspace locks), stale lock files\nleft behind on crash (HEAD.lock, worktree `locked` marker), fail-open paths, a\ncrash between any two steps, error paths that skip cleanup.\n","kind":"task","labels":["release","sweep"],"parent":"bn-1eyd","size":"m","title":"Sweep B: FF-absorb, concurrency and crash-safety changes since pre.15"}	blake3:Z4SWNQg7YWyVGV81y0oQDIOxL9SXG3Uf5vqiYPwRM50
1790528162377851	maw-68q58s	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-ggo5	{"description":"Fresh-eyes sweep (method in parent bn-1eyd). SLICE (changes in\nv1.0.0-pre.15..HEAD):\n  crates/maw-core/src/config.rs + model/layout.rs (bn-2dyz canonical config path,\n    legacy fallback + warnings — check every config reader and both layouts incl.\n    legacy v2 bare), crates/maw-cli/src/ref_gc.rs (bn-3maj pin age),\n  crates/maw-cli/src/workspace/capture.rs, recover.rs, undo.rs,\n    crates/maw-core/src/model/path_safety.rs (bn-2wav extraction — did behaviour\n    change for real inputs, e.g. non-UTF-8 paths, Windows-style separators?),\n  crates/maw-lfs/src/pointer.rs, hex.rs, batch.rs, store.rs,\n    crates/maw-git/src/lfs_clean.rs (bn-z9t3 stricter parse — can a real pointer in a\n    user repo now be misclassified? legacy hawser URL?),\n  crates/maw-cli/src/workspace/list.rs + mod.rs (quarantine display),\n  crates/maw-core/src/model/types.rs (epoch-delta reservation, WorkspaceId),\n  crates/maw-core/src/merge/quarantine_id.rs, model/ordering.rs, model/patch.rs.\nFocus: upgrade path for existing users (repos created by older maw: legacy config\nfile, legacy quarantine dirs, existing workspace named epoch-delta, recovery refs\nwith old name formats), fail-open validation, recovery commands still working.\n","kind":"task","labels":["release","sweep"],"parent":"bn-1eyd","size":"m","title":"Sweep C: layout, config, recovery, path safety and LFS changes since pre.15"}	blake3:YMufKGqM-50L63YqVoQ48MjBLdSPHLA0v4QhJnacDss
