1790532157433454	maw-68q58s	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-jfj2	{"body":"bn-jfj2 fix + mutation evidence (all reverted after RED):\nM1 CLI abandon skips the pin and passes no proof: library guard refuses -> abandon_pins_committed_fix_and_uncommitted_edit_for_recover and abandon_of_untouched_quarantine_still_pins_candidate FAILED (maw merge abandon exits nonzero).\nM2 M1 plus library verify_removal_proof disabled (the original bug): both tests FAILED, \"abandon must print the recovery command\" / no recovery pin.\nM3 commit_quarantine_edits back to raw fs::write of HEAD: commit_edits_moves_head_with_reflog FAILED \"HEAD move must be recorded in the reflog\".\nM4 promote cleanup never pins (always CleanAndReachable from the branch): promote_cleanup_pins_edits_made_after_promote_committed FAILED (late.txt written by validation after the commit is lost).\nRed-first: all three CLI tests in tests/quarantine_abandon_recovery_bn_jfj2.rs failed on trunk before the fix. just check green after."}	blake3:dFm_tTYTBk9m8-DR8KH-l4yVSPNKl8OaIB-tGJU_qLo
1790532657520570	maw-68q58s	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-jfj2	{"body":"Follow-up: undo.rs redestroy_sources fails closed per source. Red-first test crates/maw-cli/tests/undo_cli.rs redo_leaves_source_in_place_when_capture_fails (chmod-000 untracked file in restored source; skipped under root). Mutation: capture Err mapped back to None -> test FAILED 'a source whose capture failed must NOT be destroyed'; reverted. just check green."}	blake3:t3eY2RuJbmTtIWCAP1W4EH5EUMsM_aDEX0--VlDDoak
