1790541138041016	maw-nzv80n	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-1ijl	{"body":"Root cause: gix rewrite tracker emits directory-level (tree->tree, Relation::Parent) Rewrite entries alongside per-file child rewrites; maw-git diff_trees_with_renames passed them through as Renamed with tree OIDs; diff_patchset read_blob'd the tree. Any identical subtree deleted at one path and added at another triggers it (not specific to the already-applied-upstream case). Fixed in ws bn-1ijl commit 1bca972b (drop tree rewrites at source; also gitlink->file Modified now carries content). Tests: maw-git tests/diff_tree_shapes.rs, maw-core diff_extract proptest, tests/sync_dir_move_bn_1ijl.rs. just check green."}	blake3:UmFamavanEYdg6NBJRzMCFA3hfA88jOw2eDUyHP2pBY
