1790543798363375	maw-nzv80n	itc:AQ		item.move	bn-28s78	{"state":"doing"}	blake3:-xLJT0TObsyYLqMSgqQ4hV2UL21FPStvyWQYavCc33Q
1790543798375528	maw-nzv80n	itc:AQ		item.assign	bn-28s78	{"action":"assign","agent":"maw-nzv80n"}	blake3:9Gr5Pk6BeFkBTnwiqXtNo2KKq-BCHVJFpmucBu49hlY
1790544951764174	maw-nzv80n	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-28s78	{"body":"bn-28s78 worker evidence (workspace bn-28s78, commit f14a3dc9)\n\n(2) resolved_paths — ANALYSIS: update_default_workspace only forwarded it to replay_snapshot_with_merge_protection, where a stash path is 3-way-merged if (a) in resolved_paths OR (b) committed_content_changed(anchor, epoch_after). (a) only adds paths whose committed bytes the merge left UNCHANGED (base == ours). There the 3-way result == user's version for diff3/union/ours; for merge=binary or a user DELETION it produced a spurious \"local-vs-merge conflict\", which verify_trunk_replay_fidelity (bn-1xmk) then overwrote with the user's version anyway. So bytes on disk never differed; the report did (live: false conflict + fidelity alarm; recovered with &[]: clean). Repro: a,b both edit f.txt, [[merge.drivers]] kind=ours on f.txt (resolved back to epoch bytes), trunk dirty `rm f.txt` (or edit under merge=binary).\nFIX: dropped the resolved_paths parameter (update_default_workspace + replay_snapshot_with_merge_protection); replay depends only on (anchor, merged commit, snapshot), which live merge, recovery and promote all have. No journal change needed (old journals unaffected).\n\n(1) hooks — DECISION: recovery never runs [hooks] post_merge (the live merge runs them after clearing the journal, so a journal proves they never ran; recovery can be much later / inside another merge's start). It prints \"Post-merge hooks were NOT run ... To run them now, from the repo root:\" + each command, and JSON has post_merge_hooks_skipped.\n\n(3) Removed dead maw-core recover_from_merge_state (it DELETED a cleanup-phase journal without cleanup — the bn-1fcox bug shape), run_cleanup_phase, and abort_merge_state/AbortOutcome (dead since bn-1fcox rewired --abort). New maw_core::merge_state::clear_merge_journal (journal + sidecars) used by both live merge CLEANUP and recover.rs. Tests converted to decide_journal_recovery + clear_merge_journal.\n\nRED-FIRST (new crates/maw-cli/tests/merge_crash_recovery_bn_28s78.rs vs pre-fix src): 3/3 FAILED —\n live: TargetState{... false_conflict_reported: true, fidelity_alarm: true}\n recovered vs live: left(recovered) clean, right(live) false_conflict/alarm -> differ\n hooks: \"must say the post-merge hooks were skipped\". With fix: 3/3 ok.\nMUTATIONS: M1 skipped_post_merge_hooks = Vec::new() -> hooks test FAILED. M2 recovery calls run_hooks after clear_journal -> hooks test FAILED (hook.log written). Reverted.\nGATES: cargo build --release -p maw-cli; just check (113 ok, 0 FAILED); cargo test -p maw-core (808 ok); maw-workspaces lib merge:: (278 ok); cargo test -p maw-assurance --features stateright + just formal-check (38 ok); just sg1-faithful-test (12 suites ok); clippy -p maw-cli --features failpoints --all-targets -D warnings clean. Stateright model unchanged (protocol unchanged); removed stale unused imports there.\n\nOUT OF SCOPE (pre-existing, both live and recovered): a dirty trunk edit to a file whose MODE the merge changed (chmod +x in ws) reverts the mode — stash_apply recreates the file with the stash's 644. Repro: ws a `chmod +x f.sh` commit; trunk edits f.sh content; merge -> git diff shows old mode 100755 new mode 100644. Also recovery does not record the target's Snapshot op (pre_checkout_patchset) and passes workspace_base_before=None (live passes backend base_epoch for non-root targets).\n"}	blake3:Pm65hjDqygYCkJivH0Ec8ArjMHiuFOACvponmOeIisQ
1790544983370493	maw-nzv80n	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-qi5br	{"body":"bn-qi5br evidence (commit 3b9f19f3, ws bn-qi5br)\n\nRed-first: tests/invalid_maw_toml_bn_qi5br.rs (broken .maw.toml: `branch = trunk`, parse error line 2).\nOn unfixed trunk code, 6/6 RED:\n- epoch_sync_refuses: succeeded, \"Epoch synced ... (branch 'main')\" (silently re-pointed epoch at main)\n- ws_create_refuses: workspace created on defaults\n- ws_sync_refuses: synced on defaults\n- ws_merge_refuses_with_line_and_fix: refused but message was only \"Failed to parse <file>\" (no line, no fix)\n- ws_status_warns_once: no warning at all\n- doctor_reports: \"epoch drift: could not check (config unreadable)\" reported as [OK]\nAfter fix: 6/6 green.\n\nMutations (each reverted):\n- M1 MawConfig::require -> Ok(load_or_warn) (global fail-open): epoch_sync, ws_create, ws_sync RED.\n- M2 load_or_warn drops its warning: ws_status_warns_once RED.\n\nGates: cargo build --release -p maw-cli OK; just check: 0 FAILED, 0 recipe errors (pre-existing maw-assurance unused-import warning on trunk, not from this change).\n"}	blake3:8AwwwyyInQbSAgRNc-vYb2T_6D8TKuvH4aOyK5PhErM
1790545009823781	maw-nzv80n	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-2eszz	{"body":"Evidence (commit 97d5adaa, ws bn-2eszz)\n\nNew: crates/maw-cli/src/workspace/destroy_content_check.rs (detect -> Option<ContentAlreadyInEpoch>), DestroyRefusal.content_already_in_epoch + NOTE line in text refusal, JSON field (null when absent). Refusal gate unchanged.\nTests: tests/destroy_content_in_epoch_bn_2eszz.rs (6): hint for tree-equals-epoch, changes-present-in-epoch, patches-in-epoch; no hint for genuinely unmerged, partially cherry-picked, cherry-picked-but-dirty. Every case asserts destroy still refuses and ws still exists. Unit: destroy_guidance content_already_in_epoch_note_renders_only_when_set.\n\nMutation results (each reverted):\n== M1 drop dirty guard\ntest genuinely_unmerged_commit_refuses_without_hint ... ok\ntest cherry_picked_but_dirty_refuses_without_hint ... FAILED\ntest partially_cherry_picked_refuses_without_hint ... ok\ntest cherry_picked_content_still_refuses_but_explains ... ok\ntest cherry_picked_then_epoch_moved_on_matches_by_patch_id ... ok\ntest cherry_picked_then_unrelated_epoch_change_matches_by_content ... ok\ntest result: FAILED. 5 passed; 1 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 24 filtered out; finished in 0.40s\n== M2 changes_present always true\ntest genuinely_unmerged_commit_refuses_without_hint ... FAILED\ntest cherry_picked_but_dirty_refuses_without_hint ... ok\ntest partially_cherry_picked_refuses_without_hint ... FAILED\ntest cherry_picked_content_still_refuses_but_explains ... ok\ntest cherry_picked_then_epoch_moved_on_matches_by_patch_id ... FAILED\ntest cherry_picked_then_unrelated_epoch_change_matches_by_content ... ok\ntest result: FAILED. 3 passed; 3 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 24 filtered out; finished in 0.41s\n== M3 patch-id accepts +\ntest genuinely_unmerged_commit_refuses_without_hint ... FAILED\ntest partially_cherry_picked_refuses_without_hint ... FAILED\ntest cherry_picked_but_dirty_refuses_without_hint ... ok\ntest cherry_picked_content_still_refuses_but_explains ... ok\ntest cherry_picked_then_epoch_moved_on_matches_by_patch_id ... ok\ntest cherry_picked_then_unrelated_epoch_change_matches_by_content ... ok\ntest result: FAILED. 4 passed; 2 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 24 filtered out; finished in 0.38s\n== M4 weaken refusal when hint applies\ntest genuinely_unmerged_commit_refuses_without_hint ... ok\ntest cherry_picked_but_dirty_refuses_without_hint ... ok\ntest partially_cherry_picked_refuses_without_hint ... ok\ntest cherry_picked_content_still_refuses_but_explains ... FAILED\ntest cherry_picked_then_epoch_moved_on_matches_by_patch_id ... FAILED\ntest cherry_picked_then_unrelated_epoch_change_matches_by_content ... FAILED\ntest result: FAILED. 3 passed; 3 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 24 filtered out; finished in 0.47s\n== M5 drop note from text\ntest genuinely_unmerged_commit_refuses_without_hint ... ok\ntest partially_cherry_picked_refuses_without_hint ... ok\ntest cherry_picked_content_still_refuses_but_explains ... FAILED\ntest cherry_picked_but_dirty_refuses_without_hint ... ok\ntest cherry_picked_then_epoch_moved_on_matches_by_patch_id ... FAILED\ntest cherry_picked_then_unrelated_epoch_change_matches_by_content ... FAILED\ntest result: FAILED. 3 passed; 3 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 24 filtered out; finished in 0.37s\n\nGates: cargo build --release -p maw-cli OK; TMPDIR=/var/tmp/bn-2eszz just check -> 0 recipe failures, 0 'test result: FAILED'.\n"}	blake3:Ws_daTNBu3fFVo496DlnRh1rAl-E2KFnTWaH6xa7Zns
